  "OBSERVED": [
   "S1R formal negative result is independently reproduced from 50 NPZ: entry +0.066634727 (p=5.96e-8), matched-320 KC -0.001430625 (p=0.352361), matched-95 MBON -0.001760000 (p=0.438998).",
